{"2822980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ARSONATE", "steam_appid": 2822980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822980/extras/86ccbb3037a53f61c3df8cc31f5c537c.poster.avif?t=1785741441\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822980/extras/86ccbb3037a53f61c3df8cc31f5c537c.webm?t=1785741441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822980/extras/86ccbb3037a53f61c3df8cc31f5c537c.mp4?t=1785741441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥LOCKED IN A FIRE TOWER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A [HOST] challenges you to a deadly game of chance where a <strong><i>forest fire</i></strong> spreads with each flip of a card.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose where the fire spreads, but only on <i><strong>your</strong></i> side of the field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The more turns you take, the closer the fire gets.</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎲'A GAME OF CHANCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some cards have a chance to deliver a <i><strong>random utility</strong></i>, or force you to <i><strong>take another turn</strong></i>. Choose wisely. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🪓USE UTILITIES TO OUTWIT THE [HOST]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Utility has unique way of <strong><i>skewing the odds of the game.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use their various effects to your advantage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822980/extras/0a80a364b80b35d08f6d71d3fd395d2b.poster.avif?t=1785741441\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822980/extras/0a80a364b80b35d08f6d71d3fd395d2b.webm?t=1785741441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822980/extras/0a80a364b80b35d08f6d71d3fd395d2b.mp4?t=1785741441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\t🃏A ZERO-SUM GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every card type has a <strong><i>fixed amount</i></strong>. Count them to make the best decision possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But count carefully, <strong><i>the [HOST] is keeping track as well</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How well does your memory stack up?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📖3 POSSIBLE ENDINGS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each ending has a <strong><i>unique title screen</i></strong>, revealing a deeper story to the game.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822980/extras/86ccbb3037a53f61c3df8cc31f5c537c.poster.avif?t=1785741441\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822980/extras/86ccbb3037a53f61c3df8cc31f5c537c.webm?t=1785741441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822980/extras/86ccbb3037a53f61c3df8cc31f5c537c.mp4?t=1785741441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥LOCKED IN A FIRE TOWER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A [HOST] challenges you to a deadly game of chance where a <strong><i>forest fire</i></strong> spreads with each flip of a card.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose where the fire spreads, but only on <i><strong>your</strong></i> side of the field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The more turns you take, the closer the fire gets.</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎲'A GAME OF CHANCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some cards have a chance to deliver a <i><strong>random utility</strong></i>, or force you to <i><strong>take another turn</strong></i>. Choose wisely. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🪓USE UTILITIES TO OUTWIT THE [HOST]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Utility has unique way of <strong><i>skewing the odds of the game.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use their various effects to your advantage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822980/extras/0a80a364b80b35d08f6d71d3fd395d2b.poster.avif?t=1785741441\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822980/extras/0a80a364b80b35d08f6d71d3fd395d2b.webm?t=1785741441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822980/extras/0a80a364b80b35d08f6d71d3fd395d2b.mp4?t=1785741441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\t🃏A ZERO-SUM GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every card type has a <strong><i>fixed amount</i></strong>. Count them to make the best decision possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But count carefully, <strong><i>the [HOST] is keeping track as well</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How well does your memory stack up?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📖3 POSSIBLE ENDINGS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each ending has a <strong><i>unique title screen</i></strong>, revealing a deeper story to the game.</p>", "short_description": "Outwit the HOST in a death game where fire spreads with each flip of a card. Be the last to burn. Do you fear death?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Kore